WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.746
"I am wet," said Bat.

2
00:00:09.747 --> 00:00:12.263
"And I am lost.

3
00:00:12.264 --> 00:00:16.493
I must find a dry place.

4
00:00:16.494 --> 00:00:20.590
I must find a safe place."

5
00:00:20.591 --> 00:00:23.969
So Bat flew and flew.

6
00:00:23.970 --> 00:00:28.389
He looked all around.

7
00:00:28.390 --> 00:00:34.123
The wind was strong.

8
00:00:34.124 --> 00:00:39.113
The rain was wet.

9
00:00:39.114 --> 00:00:41.899
Bat did not see a dry place.

10
00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:45.604
He did not see a safe place.

11
00:00:45.605 --> 00:00:49.238
Then Bat saw something.

12
00:00:49.239 --> 00:00:55.767
It was big and red.

13
00:00:55.768 --> 00:01:00.344
It was a barn!

14
00:01:00.345 --> 00:01:02.854
Bat flew to the roof.

15
00:01:02.855 --> 00:01:08.761
He went over the side.

16
00:01:08.762 --> 00:01:11.347
He hung by his toes.

17
00:01:11.348 --> 00:01:14.745
He looked for a way to get in.

18
00:01:14.746 --> 00:01:19.418
Then Bat saw a hole.

19
00:01:19.419 --> 00:01:22.488
It was little.

20
00:01:22.489 --> 00:01:28.921
But so was Bat.

